## 9. Connection Management

### Connection String Format

```bash
# CockroachDB Cloud (Serverless / Dedicated)
postgresql://<user>:<password>@<host>:26257/<database>?sslmode=verify-full

# Self-Hosted with TLS
postgresql://<user>:<password>@<host>:26257/<database>?sslmode=verify-full&sslrootcert=/path/to/ca.crt

# Local Development (insecure)
postgresql://root@localhost:26257/<database>?sslmode=disable
```

### Connection Pooling

| Setting | Recommendation |
|---------|---------------|
| Pool size | `4 × vCPUs` per application instance |
| Max connections per node | 100 (CockroachDB Cloud default) |
| Idle timeout | 5–10 minutes |
| Max lifetime | 30 minutes (rotate connections) |
| Validation query | `SELECT 1` |

### ⛔ ANTI-PATTERN: No Connection Validation

```java
// ❌ WRONG — stale connections after node restarts/drains
HikariConfig config = new HikariConfig();
config.setJdbcUrl("jdbc:postgresql://...");
```

```java
// ✅ CORRECT — validate connections and set proper timeouts
HikariConfig config = new HikariConfig();
config.setJdbcUrl("jdbc:postgresql://...");
config.setMaximumPoolSize(4 * Runtime.getRuntime().availableProcessors());
config.setConnectionTimeout(10_000);      // 10s to acquire connection
config.setIdleTimeout(300_000);           // 5min idle before eviction
config.setMaxLifetime(1_800_000);         // 30min max lifetime
config.setConnectionTestQuery("SELECT 1");
config.setKeepaliveTime(60_000);          // 1min keepalive
```

### Always Use `sslmode=verify-full` in Production

- CockroachDB Cloud **requires** TLS
- Self-hosted: generate certs with `cockroach cert`
- Never use `sslmode=disable` outside local development

